Take Friends

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:03.280
Very good. Well done.

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:07.340
Next, put the kanten jelly 
on the star and finish it up.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:09.640
It's done!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.890
Thank you for letting me help, sir!

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:18.510
It's nothing. When an order comes in, 
meeting expectations is what an artisan does.

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:20.570
Now, hurry and wrap it up.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.400
Yes, sir!

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.460
She's here.

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:33.410
Itsuka!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.700
Mama.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:39.540
The fir tree is beautiful. 
Thank you for decorating it.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.250
Your work... Are you sure this is okay?

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.170
You don't have to worry about that.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.170
After all, I made you a promise, Itsuka.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:47.680
Mama...

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:50.940
Hurry up and get going. 
You'll run out of time.

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:53.920
I'm sorry. I'll be borrowing Itsuka.

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:57.690
What are you talking about? 
We're the ones borrowing her.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:00.410
We're going now!

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.500
They've gone.

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:08.200
It's fine. She's coming back, after all.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.700
<b>Christmas
 Illuminations Special Edition
A selection of venues open on a daily basis from 12/17~25 
 Plus special coupons and information

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:13.700
<i>This past week, I couldn't work 
up the courage to say anything,</i>

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:16.940
<i>but I don't care if he says no! 
Being a woman is all about being brave!</i>

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:21.080
<i>And I've rehearsed what I was 
going to say so much for this!</i>

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.830
<i>Okay. Before I ask him, 
I'll do it one more time.</i>

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:29.630
Nagomu-san! After work, would you like 
to go see illumination displays with me?

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:30.550
Sure.

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:33.180
It won't be until after I've 
finished the prep work, though.

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.610
What did you do, Nagomu?!

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:38.560
I didn't do anything!

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.310
<b>Traditional Confectionery</b>

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.310
<b>Ryokushou</b>

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.310
Excuse me for leaving first!

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:45.070
<i>Squee! I have to hurry home and get ready!</i>

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.300
Thanks for your work again today.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.320
I'll be counting on all of you tomorrow, too.

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.130
Yes, sir!

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.800
Nagomu-san, are you going out?

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:14.640
Yeah.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.680
Saki-kun, are you headed anywhere?

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:19.630
My friends are having a party, 
so I'm going to pop in.

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:20.850
Excuse me!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.400
Here, if you want them.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.440
Because you're always taking care of me.

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.920
Thank you!

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.100
You're so conscientious.

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:28.300
Well, thank you everyone!

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:29.930
Oh! Masa-san!

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:33.770
Here! It's a thank you for 
always looking after me!

00:15:33.770 --> 00:15:35.180
I can really have that?

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:35.770
Yes!

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:37.660
<i>Wow, that's blatant.</i>

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:40.120
Okay, I'm heading out first!

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:49.050
Are you going out?

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.640
Kanoko...

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:53.360
Huh? Did we agree to meet?

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:56.700
No, we didn't! We didn't, but...

00:15:56.700 --> 00:16:01.640
It's Christmas Eve and I'm alone, 
so if you were free, I thought maybe...

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:09.640
<i>I'm so glad I got here first.</i>

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:11.990
<i>I need time to prepare my heart, after all.</i>

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:13.340
Mitsuru-chan!

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:13.950
Nagomu-sa...

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.070
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.450
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:17.850
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.710
Wow, it's so cute!

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.820
Did you think this up, Itsuka?

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:31.550
It's our usual jouyo manju and kinton dough. 
I just had it arranged a little differently.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.710
And I helped a little putting 
the finishing touches on.

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:36.140
Really? Thank you!

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:39.390
If I eat them, they'll disappear. 
It seems like a shame.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.680
I'll show them to my father 
and the others, too.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:42.980
Your father?

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:46.060
Your grandpa and grandma in France.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.360
They wanted to see you.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.610
You don't remember them very well, do you?

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:53.240
You've lived apart from them 
for a long time, after all.

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:58.240
And I was always working, so I couldn't 
make time to see them, either.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.990
There were times I couldn't 
keep my promises, too.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:03.660
I'm really sorry about those...

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:04.460
Huh?

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.410
<i>I've never seen that look
 on Itsuka's face before.</i>

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.750
<i>Why are those three together?!</i>

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:14.240
<i>Nagomu-san must've invited them 
without thinking it through.</i>

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.650
I'm no good, am I?

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:15.470
Just the fact that you're meeting 
with me like this is enough.

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.170
<i>He needs to stop being like that!</i>

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:18.820
I mean, I do hope that one day 
we can live together, but...

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.200
So insensitive.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:23.720
Y-You're right. I'm still not thinking 
things through well enough.

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:24.520
Huh?

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:27.360
N-No! I wasn't saying that about you, Mama!

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:28.860
R-Really?

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:30.630
P-Please don't let it bother you!

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:34.300
<i>Nagomu-san, let it bother </i>you<i>!</i>

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:35.400
<i>What was that?</i>

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.950
Mitsuru-chan, you've come here before?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:42.490
Yes. It was really pretty, 
so I wanted to come see it again.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:46.080
When did the two of you 
become such good friends?

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:48.250
You don't see each other very 
often at the shop, right?

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:52.120
It's true we don't see each other much, 
but we became friends over the summer, right?

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:52.750
Yes.

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:56.330
<i>I'm so glad Kanoko-san is here.</i>

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:58.360
<i>I'm just realizing it now,</i>

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:01.420
<i>but it might have been exhausting 
with just the two of us.</i>

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:05.760
<i>Looks like her heart's packed 
with as much as it can take.</i>

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:07.770
<i>I'm jealous of that feeling 
of not having room to breathe.</i>

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:11.270
Wow, this is amazing!

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.130
<i>Now that I think about it,</i>

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:18.600
<i>Nagomu was always out on 
Christmas Eve, playing events.</i>

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:21.140
<i>I could only ever see him the day after.</i>

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:23.370
I'm sorry I always leave you 
on your own for Christmas Eve.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:27.870
But thank you for being 
with me this year, too.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:39.380
<i>Nagomu-san's hand. This might be the 
first time I've seen it up close!</i>

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:43.390
<i>Now I'm conscious of it, 
my heart is suddenly racing!</i>

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:47.960
Nagomu-san...

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:53.340
It's from home. Please excuse me a moment!

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:54.630
Watch out!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.570
You'll run into someone.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:58.280
Thank you so...

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.030
much?!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.000
I'm sorry!

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.790
No. I'm sorry.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:09.540
<i>Squee! The feel of his hand! 
I'll never forget it!</i>

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:13.290
I wonder if she's weirded out after 
getting grabbed by an old guy.

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:14.550
What's this?

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:16.300
Hey!

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:19.180
<i>I don't have any of that 
fresh innocence left.</i>

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:21.360
What is it? Why are you 
treating me like this?

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:23.000
Has your hand changed a little?

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:23.840
Huh?

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:27.790
How can I put it? I can't explain it.
 It's just a feeling.

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:32.020
Well... They still won't let 
me work with the sweets,

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:35.980
but maybe it's because my awareness 
is different when I use my hands now?

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:40.570
Veteran artisans lose the hair on their 
fingers from the heat of the sweets.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:43.920
And for sanitary purposes, you have
 to take care of your nails,

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:46.830
so I've heard that a lot of 
them have pretty fingers.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.470
Oh, right! Kanoko, you've influenced this.

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:50.040
What?

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:53.760
You didn't cut your nails, 
you filed them, right?

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:57.100
That way you don't cut them too short, 
and you can do careful maintenance.

00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:58.050
It's really convenient.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:01.550
Then dating me wasn't for nothing.

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:04.360
I've never thought it was.

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:08.560
And I'm glad you're with me this year, too.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:13.480
I mean, Itsuka's not here. And being with 
Mitsuru-chan alone would be a little, you know...

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.230
Yes, yes.

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.230
Mitsuru-chan.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:20.800
They told me to start 
getting ready to come home.

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:23.280
Oh, it's already this late?

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:25.280
Then I suppose we should go 
our separate ways, right?

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.680
U-Um...

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.470
Here! It's a Christmas present!

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.160
What? I can have that?

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:33.920
I couldn't find the right 
timing to give it to you.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:35.260
Here.

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:35.900
Huh?

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:37.290
Kanoko, you're giving me something, too?

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:39.630
Wow! Can I open it?

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.550
Please do.

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:44.800
Whoa... No way! Are these homemade?

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.550
They look yummy!

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:50.220
A tenugui towel? I use these 
at work, so this is a huge help!

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.140
Thank you both!

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:54.570
<i>I see. Something he'd use at work.</i>

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:58.270
<i>It won't get in the way, plus he'll always 
keep it close. It's good all around!</i>

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:01.660
<i>I can't give something handmade 
to a man I've broken up with once!</i>

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:04.860
<i>Since she's young, the emotional weight 
of "handmade" transforms into cuteness!</i>

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:08.830
Kanoko-san, your present 
has such a lovely pattern!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:12.500
Later, please tell me what 
shop you found it in!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:16.200
But Mitsuru-chan, your 
cupcakes look so delicious!

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:19.750
Tell me the recipe later. 
I'd like to try making them!

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:22.880
<b>Tee

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:24.570
Wait there just a moment, both of you.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.160
Nagomu?

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:30.630
Thank you.

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:33.270
He said he's already wrapping up.

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:36.310
I asked him to let me play just one song.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:43.530
Today, this is my Christmas 
present to the two of you.

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:07.280
Oh.

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:10.220
That's... Isn't that Nagomu-san?

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:19.610
May everyone be happy.

00:23:49.990 --> 00:24:10.010
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:49.990 --> 00:24:10.010
<b>"Reminiscing About Waiting for Spring"</b>

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:52.010
It's the first sunrise.

00:23:52.010 --> 00:23:53.610
Wow.

00:23:54.540 --> 00:23:57.480
Today it's just the preorders.

00:23:57.480 --> 00:24:00.260
Oh, is that right?

00:24:01.630 --> 00:24:03.210
This is Koume-san?

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:04.830
I'll look for Koume-san!

00:24:04.830 --> 00:24:06.210
Where?

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:08.280
Buddhist temples and parks and places!
